My question would be what level were you? 15-16 would be the minimum IMHO. 
I've not done it until over 20 sometimes. The last time I woke rodney I was 
max level - 30. Mostly from wraiths of course.

You *have* to create stashes in nethack. There simply is no other way. My 
method involves putting one at the bottom of sokoban beside the up stairs 
into it, at the level decending into the mines (perhaps one halfway up from 
the bottom of the mines). and one every 5 levels beside the up stairs. This 
way you can use the BOH to *carry* stuff *between* stashes, but aside from 
that, you simply carry in empty and use sacks for items like most of your 
potions, scrolls wands and rings. You *do* keep a *couple* of the former in 
your main inventory - such as one of your rings of conflict, a wand of 
fire/lightning, a potion of extra/full healing (uncursed *not* blessed - 
they're to valuable to get higher max HP), and a scroll of teleport. 
Carrying MM's around with you along with multiple weapons, more than 
perhaps 3-4 food rations and an extra cloak, boots, helm and gloves is 
simply going to lead to the same result as above.

You can go with every 10 levels if boxes and chests are rare, but I've
never had a game where I didn't run into a chest before Ludios. Did
you check for/do Ludios?

Oh, and *never* carry boxes/chests with *anything* in them and drop them 
*immediately* when you encounter a monster.




